nt out bucket names\nprint(list_buckets_client(gcs))\n```\n\n```python\n# Cell 3: Python code to authenticate with Azure using azure-identity and azure-storage-blob libraries\nfrom azure.identity import AzureCliCredential\nfrom azure.storage.blob import BlobServiceClient, BlobClient, ContainerClient\n\n# Authenticate using the Azure CLI credentials\ncredential = AzureCliCredential()\n\n# Replace 'your_connection_string' with the actual Azure Blob Service connection string\n",
